{"title":"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/e/d3ef0ac1c543f345ae79821f1c640f715acb11b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\kappa, \\lambda, \\nu$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> are positive integers, then the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/169028f8970c2ad16ab457b006c4716a30b9c2b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-(\\nu +2)\\kappa\\lambda x+\\kappa^2\\lambda^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"218\" height=\"19\" /> has irrational roots.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that the square root of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Discriminant\" title=\"Discriminant\">discriminant</a> of the quadratic is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/f/49f7541fa28d0eefe20503b368c1d30898ce139c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{(\\nu + 2)^2\\kappa^2\\lambda^2 - 4\\kappa^2\\lambda^2} = \\sqrt{(\\kappa\\lambda)^2(\\nu^2 + 4\\nu + 4 - 4)} = \\kappa\\lambda\\sqrt{\\nu^2+4\\nu}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"524\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/a/d6a7ccf879c4a4fe694033606332cb83806db296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\nu$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> is a positive integer: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/4/6046ab26583842df16ac8e40e6d21c9d77edb4a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\nu+1)^2 &lt; \\nu^2+4\\nu &lt; (\\nu+2)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"232\" height=\"19\" />. \n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d939f890a15a96eab52d4777ee590d7ab75077c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\nu^2+4\\nu$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> is a non-perfect square, and thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/d/75d94cebad3ec6d8f31cba0f044847bc3a21c813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\nu^2+4\\nu}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> is irrational. \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/6/da61bb0fa48fe71269aebf9c8e56b39275813994.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\kappa$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce4588fd900d02afcbd260bc07f54cce49a7dc4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lambda$\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> are integers, the square root of the discriminant: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/7/d57cc5b8e984689add56fbfb031eee44ece23dd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\kappa\\lambda\\sqrt{\\nu^2+4\\nu}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" /> is irrational. \n</p><p>Therefore, the quadratic: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/169028f8970c2ad16ab457b006c4716a30b9c2b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-(\\nu +2)\\kappa\\lambda x+\\kappa^2\\lambda^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"218\" height=\"19\" /> has irrational roots. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/13017cf0d25d14fc45d517abf5080bee1c075c73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbb{Q.E.D.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"65\" height=\"26\" />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_2\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 2\">Previous Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_4\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 4\">Next Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_competition\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018110852\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 72/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2351/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser